# Files a fresh clone needs. Narrow on purpose: only the app manifest and icons, and invented files marked TEST.
!dev/app/manifest.json
!dev/app/icon-*.png
!dev/test-data/*TEST*.json
!dev/test-data/*TEST*.csv
!deploy/app/manifest.json
!deploy/app/icon-*.png
!deploy/app/try/manifest.json
!deploy/app/try/*TEST*.json
!deploy/app/try/*TEST*.csv
.superpowers/
.claude/worktrees/

# Real children's data. No test needs it any more (the four real-file tests run on dev/test-data) and the folder was moved out of the project on 2026-11-14 (to ~/awana-real-data-private).
# The entry stays as a guard: if a folder with this name is ever put back, git ignores the whole folder by name, whatever the file types.
dev/test-inputs-REAL-DATA-do-not-commit/

